   "name": "Project-Based Capacity Planning Request",
   "header": "<p>Request new infrastructure for a project, more capacity for an existing one, a modernization, or give resources back. The form asks only what applies to your request and takes about 5 minutes.</p><p>Every request is linked to its GLPI project, approved by your manager, and tracked in the project reports.</p>",
   "description": "<p>Servers, VMs, storage and GPU capacity for projects: new, expansion, modernization or release.</p>",
